Analog Canvas VACASK analytical RC qualification

ground 0
load "resistor.osdi"
load "capacitor.osdi"
model resistance resistor
model capacitance capacitor
model voltage vsource

V1 (input 0) voltage dc=0 mag=1 type="pulse" val0=0 val1=1 delay=1m rise=1u fall=1u width=20m period=40m
R1 (input output) resistance r=1k
C1 (output 0) capacitance c=1u

control
  abort always
  options rawfile="ascii" strictsave=2 reltol=1e-8 vntol=1e-10
  save default
  analysis rc_ac ac from=10 to=10k mode="dec" points=4
  analysis rc_tran tran stop=6m step=10u maxstep=10u
endc
